            "height": 230,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Needs contact import enabled by Manychat\n\nManychat answers createSubscriber with **Permission denied to import email** until Manychat support enables contact import for the account. That is an account setting, not a connector bug.\n\nThe API cannot delete subscribers: every run leaves one contact `appmixer.e2e+<timestamp>@example.com`. Delete them in Manychat → Contacts from time to time."
